      "title": "Mapping Relationship Theory",
      "lectureOrder": 143,
      "videoOrder": 142,
      "sourceHash": "bf3c2ddd46e5a1440abeb67c336b1ad97f0a5b7ef0124a82695a2936c64f9c8b",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.2,
          "end": 2.783,
          "en": "(gentle music)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "-: It's time to give justice to the laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "It's because alien, it has its own table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "What about laptop?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "Laptop is embeddable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "So, basically, in the alien table itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "you got laptop details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "Now, it has its own issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.05,
          "en": "Because laptop is an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "it should be having its own identity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "so, it should have a separate table as an entity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 25.313,
          "en": "That's one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 25.313,
          "end": 28.47,
          "en": "Next is what if one person has multiple laptops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 28.47,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "or one alien has multiple laptops?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 30.51,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "You can't simply put adding the columns, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 35.16,
          "en": "And this will create inconsistency,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 35.16,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "because different alien will have different amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 39.03,
          "en": "of laptops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 39.03,
          "end": 42.36,
          "en": "Maybe one laptop, maybe zero laptop, maybe two, three, 10.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 42.36,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "You never know, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 47.31,
          "en": "So, it's better to have a separate entity laptop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.31,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "because it can be given to someone else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "Let's say, if you're working for a company",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "and then they give you a laptop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 53.37,
          "en": "maybe after some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 53.37,
          "end": 56.16,
          "en": "they will take your laptop and give it to someone else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 56.16,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "And maybe, you will get a brand-new laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "Okay, those are the dreams we are living in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 60.03,
          "end": 63.36,
          "en": "But the point is, what if you want to have a separate table?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 63.36,
          "end": 64.98,
          "en": "So, let's say we got alien table here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 64.98,
          "end": 67.32,
          "en": "and we got a laptop table, simple stuff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 67.32,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "Alien table will have its own details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 72.53999999999999,
          "en": "we got alien ID, alien name, alien tech.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 72.53999999999999,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "The laptop, on the other side,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "now, since this is a different table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 79.28999999999999,
          "en": "we need to have the primary key as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 79.28999999999999,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "So, let's say we got LID, which is laptop ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "then, we got brand, model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 86.34,
          "en": "and I mean, let's remove all the extra columns we had,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "which is RAM and other stuff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 89.85,
          "en": "Let's stick to three columns each,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "so that we can put that in this video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 95.46000000000001,
          "en": "Now, if you want to say, \"Okay, we got these two tables.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 95.46000000000001,
          "end": 96.457,
          "en": "So, now, I want to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 96.457,
          "end": 100.65,
          "en": "\"This particular alien has a laptop, this one,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 100.65,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "how will I do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 103.32,
          "en": "How will you map it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 106.53,
          "en": "And that's where the concept of mapping comes into picture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 106.53,
          "end": 108.63,
          "en": "And this is not the concept of Hibernate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 110.34,
          "en": "This is the database concepts, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 110.34,
          "end": 112.47,
          "en": "When you have two tables, you have two connect them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 112.47,
          "end": 113.67,
          "en": "And that's why we have a concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 113.67,
          "end": 115.83,
          "en": "of primary key or a foreign key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 117.75,
          "en": "which you connect with other table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 117.75,
          "end": 120.48,
          "en": "and you make them as a parent table or child table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 120.48,
          "end": 123.33,
          "en": "I'm just assuming that you know the concept of DBMS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 123.33,
          "end": 124.163,
          "en": "this much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 124.163,
          "end": 125.58,
          "en": "Okay, now, how will you represent it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "So, now, we want to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 129.36,
          "en": "that \"This alien has a laptop, this laptop.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "Now, if you want to achieve that, there should be some link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "So, normally, what you do is you keep one of the column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "of a laptop in the alien or vice versa.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 138.773,
          "en": "So, we can say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 138.773,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "\"Okay, we got the laptop table, we got the alien table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "What if in the alien table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "you can put the primary key of a laptop as a foreign key?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 150.03,
          "en": "Now, as a alien, I know which laptop I have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 150.03,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "And you can also write a query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 155.1,
          "en": "to fetch a detail of the alien and a detail of a laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 155.1,
          "end": 156.75,
          "en": "And that's straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 158.49,
          "en": "Now, when you have this type of relationship,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 158.49,
          "end": 161.85,
          "en": "it simply means that you have one alien has one laptop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 161.85,
          "end": 165.72,
          "en": "and this is called OneToOne relationship.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 165.72,
          "end": 166.92000000000002,
          "en": "And this is very easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 166.92000000000002,
          "end": 168.57,
          "en": "So, basically, after this relationship,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 168.57,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "this is how it'll look like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 171.9,
          "en": "And one alien will have one laptop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 171.9,
          "end": 173.57999999999998,
          "en": "another alien will have another laptop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 173.57999999999998,
          "end": 175.07999999999998,
          "en": "another alien will have another laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 175.07999999999998,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "One alien has multiple laptops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "Now, this is tricky.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 181.32,
          "en": "Because in this case, we are going for OneToMany.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 181.32,
          "end": 184.11,
          "en": "So, from a alien perspective, this is OneToMany, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 184.11,
          "end": 186.3,
          "en": "So, one alien has multiple laptops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 186.3,
          "end": 189.24,
          "en": "But from a laptop perspective, it is ManyToOne,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 189.24,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "because multiple laptop can belong to one alien, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 194.13,
          "en": "That's how it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 194.13,
          "end": 196.07999999999998,
          "en": "So, we got OneToMany from alien side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 196.07999999999998,
          "end": 197.94,
          "en": "and ManyToOne from laptop side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 197.94,
          "end": 199.177,
          "en": "Now, question arise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 199.177,
          "end": 201.72,
          "en": "\"If you want to represent the table, how will you do that?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 201.72,
          "end": 203.64,
          "en": "So, the case is very simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 203.64,
          "end": 204.48,
          "en": "What you can do is instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 204.48,
          "end": 207.39,
          "en": "of putting that column in the alien table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 207.39,
          "end": 209.7,
          "en": "what if you can put that in the laptop table?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "It's because the laptop will belong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 213.15,
          "en": "to only one alien, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 215.28,
          "en": "So, we can't put that in the alien table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 215.28,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "It's because alien cannot have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 218.85,
          "en": "let's say laptop, we have three laptops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 218.85,
          "end": 220.44,
          "en": "101, 102, 103.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 220.44,
          "end": 222.57,
          "en": "So, we can't simply say alien details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "and then 101, 102, 103.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 226.2,
          "en": "Database will not accept it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 226.2,
          "end": 228.03,
          "en": "But we can do that in the laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 228.03,
          "end": 229.82999999999998,
          "en": "In laptop, we say we can create one more column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 229.82999999999998,
          "end": 232.77,
          "en": "So, this time, we are not creating that column in the alien,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 232.77,
          "end": 233.88,
          "en": "but in the laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "And we are saying, \"Okay, this laptop belongs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 236.55,
          "en": "to this alien.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 236.55,
          "end": 239.31,
          "en": "So, in the laptop table, you'll be having AIDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 239.31,
          "end": 241.59,
          "en": "which is a foreign key in this case, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 241.59,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "And that's how we can refer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 245.25,
          "en": "Things are very simple, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 245.25,
          "end": 248.64,
          "en": "But the problem is if you try to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 249.9,
          "en": "which attrition you're going to use?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 249.9,
          "end": 252.3,
          "en": "And we'll see that in the upcoming videos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 252.3,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "which attrition we have to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 254.31,
          "en": "So, we have to use OneToMany",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 254.31,
          "end": 256.59,
          "en": "and from the laptop side, we have to use ManyToOne.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 256.59,
          "end": 259.38,
          "en": "And we want the mapping to be done in the laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 259.38,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "But what if you choose not to do that in the laptop?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 264.66,
          "en": "Let's keep alien table as it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 264.66,
          "end": 267.21,
          "en": "and laptop table as it is, no linking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 267.21,
          "end": 268.38,
          "en": "Then, how will you link it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 268.38,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "In that case, you can create a third table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 273.06,
          "en": "which is a alien_laptop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 273.06,
          "end": 275.07,
          "en": "and this will have the entire details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 275.07,
          "end": 277.02,
          "en": "So, this particular alien has this laptop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 277.02,
          "end": 278.85,
          "en": "this particular alien has this laptop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 278.85,
          "end": 280.98,
          "en": "One alien can have multiple laptops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 280.98,
          "end": 282.27,
          "en": "Quite simple, right?",
